e, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "27296607129952509"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "884455389010426"}]}, "change_log": "v1.8.10 (May 26, 2026)\n- Fix: Bullseye (25) issue and outer miss areas did not report a score and darts sink too far in to the board. This was a physics issue, problem solved.\n- Fix: Cricket AI Opponent won't throw darts when it's their turn.\n- Fix: Moving the Dartcam moves the AI dart on the 3rd throw.", "created_date": 1779822177, "id": "27296607129952509", "version": "1.8.10", "version_code": 1988, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "4034169883289562", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "27296607129952509"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "884455389010426"}]}, "change_log": "v1.8.9 (April 21, 2026)\n- Fix: Bullseye and Double Bull both score consistently now\n- Fix: X01 Double Out turned off, now allows players to win without doubling out in Single Player games, even checking out on 1\n- Fix: Enhanced scoring accuracy in all game modes. Fixed scores that reported wrong wedge for throws landing through 2 wedge colliders on an angle\n- V1 release of Hands Mode with controller like physics\n- All Hands game modes enabled with fully functioning menus (X01, ATW, Cricket)\n- New Hands Mode DartCam that allows users to pinch and point at the DartCam screen to pan and zoom the camera\n- New Dart Spawner can be grabbed and positioned for Left and Right Hand throwing without switching hands in the menu\n- New Settings menu options for Hands throw power and release angle", "created_date": 1776804395, "id": "26874835168796376", "version": "1.8.9", "version_code": 1980, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "4034169883289562", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "27296607129952509"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1776711631, "id": "26862763303336896", "version": "1.8.8", "version_code": 1967, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "4034169883289562", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "27296607129952509"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "884455389010426"}]}, "change_log": "v1.8.7 (January 19, 2026)\n- Optimized player preferences saving between sessions\n- Fixed Multiplayer X01 Bug where scores would reset 2 hands back", "created_date": 1768876461, "id": "25964781393135096", "version": "1.8.7", "version_code": 1907, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "4034